## Local first

- Run everything that can run locally first: Vitest, Node tests, native
  Worker controls, the local Bunny deployment selection, local Ruby, local
  SQLite/libSQL/MySQL. A hosted run is only for what local runs cannot show.
- Passing tests close tasks. Never delete, skip or weaken a test to get a pass.
  Any change to an existing test's assertions is called out in the commit
  message and gets independent review.

